["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Security/probability", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "The probability score between 0 and 1 (0 and 100%) estimating the likelihood of\nexploitation in the wild in the next 30 days (following score publication).\nThe definition follows \"epss\" in\nEPSS Data <https://www.first.org/epss/data_stats>.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
