["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Extension/CdxPropertyEntry", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "Each CdxPropertyEntry contains a name-value pair which maps the name to its\nassociated value.\n\nUnlike key-value stores, properties in CdxPropertiesExtension support duplicate\nnames, each potentially having different values.\n\nThis class can be used to implement CycloneDX compatible properties.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
