["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/ReproduceAction", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Reproduction is the biological process by which organisms generate new individuals of the same species.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
