["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Dataset/datasetSize", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "**NOTE:**\nThis property is deprecated and only included for backward compatibility.\nNew documents should use\n/Software/artifactSize\ninstead.\n\nHow large a dataset is.\n\nThe size is to be measured in bytes.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
