["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/Bom", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "A Bill of Materials (BOM) is a container for a grouping of SPDX 3 content\ncharacterizing details about a product.\n\nThis could include details of the content and composition of the product,\nprovenance details of the product and/or\nits composition, licensing information, known quality or security issues, etc.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
