["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/UseProcess", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "The UseProcess is an abstract class used to define processes that interact with key elements. Plan, state, and inspection processes plus managing boundaries are critical processes used by elements.\n\nRelationship:\n\nFor each UseProcess or subclass except the PlanProcess there is at least one /Core/Relationship class or subclass with the relationshipType of 'affects\u2019 on the from and a /Core/Element class or subclass on the to.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["_:N8c080a62eb8940e581bc98d28bd37b94", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first", "_:N301227294b80418c806b93f519dd4d21", "localId", "", ""]
