["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/phoneNumber", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Phone number; A string of decimal digits that uniquely indicates the network termination point defined in RFC 3966 <https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/rfc3966/> Section 5.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
