["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/CreateAction", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "CreationAction represents the lifecycle event of Product creation. A product could be manufactured, assembled, mined/extracted directly from the nature etc.\n\nRelationship:\n\nFor each CreateAction there is at least one /Core/Relationship class or subclass with the relationshipType of 'hasOutput\u2019 on the from and a /Core/Element class or subclass on the to.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/ExpandedLicensing/CustomLicenseAddition", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "A license addition that is not listed on the SPDX Exceptions List.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
