["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/LifecycleScopedRelationship", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "Certain relationships are sensitive to where they occur in the lifecycle.  This parameter lets us avoid a proliferation of relationships, by parameterizing this context information for a relationship.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
