["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Dataset/intendedUse", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "**DEPRECATED in SPDX 3.1.**\nUse /Core/intendedUse instead.\n\nThe intended use of a given dataset.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
