["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/packageVerificationCodeExcludedFile", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "A relative filename with the root of the package archive or directory\nreferencing a file to be excluded from the PackageVerificationCode.\n\nEvery filename is preceded with a ./.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
