["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalRefType/cwe", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "Common Weakness Enumeration <https://csrc.nist.gov/glossary/term/common_weakness_enumeration>. A reference to a source of software flaws defined within the official CWE List <https://cwe.mitre.org/data/> that conforms to the CWE specification <https://cwe.mitre.org/>.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
