["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/delegatedTo", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "The from Agent is delegating an action to the Agent of the to Relationship (which shall be of type invokedBy), during a LifecycleScopeType period (e.g. the to invokedBy Relationship is being done on behalf of from).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
