["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/SupportType/noAssertion", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "No assertion about the type of support is made. This is considered the default if no other support type is used.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/IndividualElement", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "Individuals, such as NoneElement and NoAssertionElement, need to reference a\nconcrete subclass of Element.\n\nThis class provides the type used by the individuals defined in the Core profile.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
