["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Software/sourceInfo", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "Records any relevant background information or additional comments\nabout the origin of the package.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
