["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/authorization", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "Authorization is a string property that captures the specific permissions, rights, privileges, or benefits that are associated with a Role. This property defines what the role is entitled to do or receive within a given context (e.g., build, system, distribution, supply chain, or lifecycle). For example, authorization might include access to certain resources, permissions to perform specific actions, or eligibility for particular benefits.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Dataset/DatasetAvailabilityType", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "Availability of dataset.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
