["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/ark", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "Archival Resource Key (ARK) <https://arks.org/about/>, is a Uniform Resource Identifier (URI) suited to being a persistent identifier for information objects of any type, standardized by the ARK Identifier Scheme <https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-kunze-ark/> Internet-Draft. It consists of the \"ark:\" label followed by a Name Assigning Authority Number, a forward slash, a name, and an optional qualifier (e.g., ark:12148/btv1b8449691v/f29).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
