["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Build/environment", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "environment is a map of environment variables and values that are set during a\nbuild session, according to the buildType.\n\nThis is different from the parameter property in that it\ndescribes the environment variables set before a build is invoked rather than\nthe variables provided to the builder.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
