["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/headquartersLocation", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "Headquarters denotes the location where most or all of the important functions\nof an organization are coordinated. In some jurisdictions, it represents the\ncentral entity of a corporation that assumes full responsibility for managing\nall business activities.\n\nAccurate identification of an organization's headquarters requires the\nprovision of relevant address data, including mailing, street, and geographic\npoint location.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["_:N7eaaa63463454f63a7c60932afa68c1b", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest", "_:N73c3f6d364c34e7ab848c1da376c0b65", "localId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/AI/metricDecisionThreshold", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "Each metric can be computed based on a decision threshold.\n\nFor instance, precision or recall is typically computed by checking if the\nprobability of the outcome is larger than 0.5.\n\nEach decision threshold shall match with a metric field defined in the AI\npackage.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
